sg-shell (0.1.0-10) unstable; urgency=medium

  * sg-zip: Compressed (zipped) Folders -- Wine has no zipfldr.dll. A .zip
    (ProgID CompressedFolder) opens as a read-only folder window with
    Windows' columns and "Extract all"; the Extract Compressed (Zipped)
    Folders wizard (destination, Browse, show when complete, progress,
    Replace or Skip); "Compress to ZIP file" on files and folders. Our own
    inflate, deflate, CRC-32 and ZIP reader/writer (ZIP64 read, UTF-8 names);
    hostile names (zip-slip) and damaged entries are refused. Headless
    /extract, /create, /list. Associations: defaults/75-sg-zip.reg.
  * Gate: test/zip-check.sh.

